.audit_notes.md
# Host-specific autotuner winners (lever (b)): produced by
# `grokking_optimizers.compile ... --jit-only`, consumed by setup.py's
# TunedBuildExtension to bake per-TU flags into _ops*.so. NOT committed —
# one host's tuned launch params must not silently apply to every build. A
# wheel built on a tuned host still ships it via package_data. Delete it to
# fall back to in-header kernel defaults. See AUTOTUNE_LINKAGE.md.
grokking_optimizers/_kernel_tuned.json
# Training data (regenerable via torchvision download) — 64 MB of binaries.
data/
# Tuner runtime artifacts: the Optuna journal + per-worker/launcher logs are
# operational scratch, not deliverables (curated summaries live in results/
# h100_grokking_race/). Era-archived journals stay local too.
results/tuning/
# NFS silly-rename handles (deleted-but-open files on NFS mounts).
.nfs*
